## Implementation Notes

### Color with Opacity

**Problem**: CSS `background-color: #FF6B6B20;` not valid
**Solution**: Use rgba or hex8
```typescript
// Option 1: Append opacity to hex
const bgColor = `${metadata.domainColor}20`; // "#FF6B6B20" (hex8 format)

// Option 2: Convert to rgba
function hexToRgba(hex: string, opacity: number): string {
  const r = parseInt(hex.slice(1, 3), 16);
  const g = parseInt(hex.slice(3, 5), 16);
  const b = parseInt(hex.slice(5, 7), 16);
  return `rgba(${r}, ${g}, ${b}, ${opacity})`;
}
const bgColor = hexToRgba(metadata.domainColor, 0.2);
```

